<!--
  BlockML Core — semantic version value type

  FQN: org.blockml.type.VersionNumber
  See docs/02_mbml.md — Block Definition · Documentation extensions · version / since / changelog
       docs/12_bom_object_model.md — Version Rules · ChangelogEntry
       docs/00_bom_core.md — Versioning
-->
<block xmlns="http://blockml.org/schema/block" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xsi:schemaLocation="http://blockml.org/schema/block https://blockml.org/schemas/core/block.xsd"
  xmlns:btype="org.blockml.type"
  xmlns:core="org.blockml.core">

  <idea>Semantic version string for BlockML definitions, documentation, and instance references.</idea>

  <documentation>
    ValueType for semantic version numbers (semver). Values use MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH form
    (for example 1.0.0, 1.3.2, 2.0.0). Unqualified name VersionNumber resolves to
    org.blockml.type.VersionNumber.

    Used wherever BlockML tracks or compares definition and reference versions:
    • &lt;version&gt; on Block, Library, and Catalog definitions — effective block version
    • &lt;since&gt; on definition elements — version from which a member is available
    • version attribute on &lt;change&gt; changelog entries (ChangeDefinition)
    • bml:version on composition instances — optional exact-version assert for external types

    Effective block version: own &lt;version&gt; if present, else library.version when the
    Block is exported via a Library, else BML_MISSING_VERSION. A Block inside a Library may
    omit &lt;version&gt;; if set, it must be &gt;= library.version (semver compare). Standalone
    blocks require &lt;version&gt;. Framework libraries (org.blockml.*, com.machineblocks.*)
    conventionally declare version only on Library.bml.

    Changelog entries must be ordered oldest-first by version (BML_CHANGELOG_VERSION_ORDER).
    Invalid semver strings on &lt;since&gt; → BML_INVALID_SINCE_VERSION. Unknown bml:version
    assert → BML_UNKNOWN_VERSION.

    See 02_mbml.md · 12_bom_object_model.md — Version Rules · 00_bom_core.md — Versioning.
  </documentation>
  <name>VersionNumber</name>
  <type>btype:VersionNumber</type>
  <baseType>core:ValueType</baseType>

  <properties>
    <version type="String">
      <documentation>
        The semantic version value (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH). Stored as a string in BOM
        BlockDefinition.version, Definition.since, ChangelogEntry.version, and instance
        bml:version asserts. Required when VersionNumber appears as a Block instance;
        rendered as element text or XML attribute at definition and changelog sites.
      </documentation>
    </version>
  </properties>
</block>
